          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ઓડકાર",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઓડકાર — oḍkār — \"a belch\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જમ્યા પછી દાદાએ મોટો ઓડકાર ખાધો. jamyā pachī dādāe moṭo oḍkār khādho. After the meal my grandfather gave a loud belch."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઓડકાર (oḍkār) probably goes back to Sanskrit udgāra, \"the act of discharging, spitting out\", as Monier-Williams records it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
